      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/problem": "The average gas price in Chicago is $\\$3.11$ per gallon. Gas prices have been *decreasing* continuously at a rate of $1.2\\%$ per month. What was the gas price $9$ months ago? Round your answer to the nearest cent.\n\n> A scientific calculator is required to answer this question.",
